   0.97      0.95       107\n","   Malignant       0.95      0.88      0.91        64\n","\n","    accuracy                           0.94       171\n","   macro avg       0.94      0.92      0.93       171\n","weighted avg       0.94      0.94      0.94       171\n","\n"]},{"data":{"image/png":"\n","text/plain":["<Figure size 2000x400 with 4 Axes>"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"}],"source":["def evaluate_classifier(name, clf, X_train, y_train, X_test, y_test):\n","    \"\"\"Report one classifier on the training and test splits.\n","\n","    Prints the classification report for the test split, then plots confusion\n","    matrices, precision recall curves and ROC curves for both splits.\n","\n","    Args:\n","        name: Classifier name used in the plot titles.\n","        clf: Fitted pipeline.\n","        X_train: Training features.\n","        y_train: Training labels.\n","        X_test: Test features.\n","        y_test: Test labels.\n","    \"\"\"\n","    print(f\"\\n===== {name} =====\")\n","    print(classification_report(y_test, clf.predict(X_test), target_names=[\"Benign\", \"Malignant\"]))\n","\n","    fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 4, figsize=(20, 4))\n","    ConfusionMatrixDisplay.from_estimator(clf, X_test, y_test, display_labels=[\"Benign\", \"Malignant\"], ax=axes[0], colorbar=False)\n","    axes[0].set_title(f\"{name}: Confusion Matrix (Test)\")\n","    ConfusionMatrixDisplay.from_estimator(clf, X_train, y_train, display_labels=[\"Benign\", \"Malignant\"], ax=axes[1], colorbar=False)\n","    axes[1].set_title(f\"{name}: Confusion Matrix (Train)\")\n","    PrecisionRecallDisplay.from_estimator(clf, X_train, y_train, name=\"Train\", ax=axes[2])\n","    PrecisionRecallDisplay.from_estimator(clf, X_test, y_test, name=\"Test\", ax=axes[2])\n","    axes[2].set_title(f\"{name}: Precision-Recall\")\n","    RocCurveDisplay.from_estimator(clf, X_train, y_train, name=\"Train\", ax=axes[3])\n","    RocCurveDisplay.from_estimator(clf, X_test, y_test, name=\"Test\", ax=axes[3])\n","    axes[3].set_title(f\"{name}: ROC Curve\")\n","    plt.tight_layout()\n","    plt.show()\n","\n","\n","# Evaluate every default classifier\n","for name, clf in classifiers_default.items():\n","    evaluate_classifier(name, clf, X_train, y_train, X_test, y_test)\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"b1645643","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.016853,"end_time":"2026-10-22T11:31:31.307926+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-22T11:31:31.291073+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## Step 7: Stratified Cross Validation\n","Every classifier is scored with stratified 5 fold cross validation on all 569 patients, which gives a more stable estimate than the single split in Step 6. Balanced accuracy, recall, precision, F1 and ROC AUC are recorded for each fold."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":13,"id":"ad317095","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-22T11:31:31.344873Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-22T11:31:31.344524Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-22T11:32:02.362377Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-22T11:32:02.361374Z"},"papermill":{"duration":31.055332,"end_time":"2026-10-22T11:32:02.380526+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-22T11:31:31.325194+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"data":{"text/html":["<div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n","        vertical-align: middle;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n","        vertical-align: top;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe thead th {\n","        text-align: right;\n","    }\n","</style>\n","<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n","  <thead>\n","    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n","      <th></th>\n","      <th>Classifier</th>\n","      <th>Balanced Acc (mean)</th>\n","      <th>Balanced Acc (std)</th>\n","      <th>Recall (mean)</th>\n","      <th>Precision (mean)</th>\n","      <th>F1 (mean)</th>\n","      <th>ROC-AUC (mean)</th>\n","    </tr>\n","  </thead